{"id":"u-61aa2fea-9dc1-4734-b5b4-3bc5afecf893","src":"community","title":"Luke’s Hypertrophy Hybrid","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/KMEWJE-lukes-hypertrophy-hybrid","desc":"Luke’s Hypertrophy Hybrid is a comprehensive 12-week program designed to maximize muscle growth and strength through a balanced approach. With five days of training per week, you'll engage in a variety of exercises that target all major muscle groups, utilizing both free weights and machines. Each session lasts about 60 minutes, ensuring an effective workout without overwhelming your schedule. Ideal for intermediate to advanced lifters, this program combines compound movements with isolation exercises to sculpt your physique and enhance your lifting performance. Get ready to push your limits and achieve the gains you've been striving for!\n\nHeavy Squat, Bench, Overhead Press and Deadlift for chasing weight, heavy rows for pulling strength and some standard 10-12 rep accessories to chase the pump. Moderate volume.\n\nAscending RPE every week 8>8.5>9 with an RPE 7 “reload” every 4th week. Run for the 12 scheduled weeks, take a full deload week then repeat as required.\n\nSchedule:\n\nUpper \nLower A\nRest\nChest and Back\nLower B\nShoulders and Arms","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-08-15T12:39:44.381Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper","Lower A","Chest and Back","Lower B","Shoulders and Arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bayesian Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]}]}]},{